{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n222\ndred press is at their service. These are the allies of the bour-\ngeois  counter-revolution.\nFoul slander against political opponents will help the\nworkers to realise all the sooner where the counter-revolu-\ntion is, and to sweep it away in the name of freedom, peace,\nbread  for  the  hungry  and  land  for  the  peasants.\nWritten  between  July  22  and  26\n(August  4  and  8),  1917\nPublished  in  Rabochy  i  Soldat\nPublished  according  to\nNos.  3  and  4,  July  26  and  27,  1917\nthe  manuscript\nSigned:  N.  Lenin", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "222", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.58, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "dred press is at their service. These are the allies of the bour-", "x": 11.11, "y": 9.53, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "geois  counter-revolution.", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 33.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Foul slander against political opponents will help the", "x": 13.9, "y": 13.39, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "workers to realise all the sooner where the counter-revolu-", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tion is, and to", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 19.38, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sweep it away", "x": 30.93, "y": 17.28, "w": 18.95, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "in the name of freedom, peace,", "x": 50.31, "y": 17.27, "w": 40.82, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "bread  for  the  hungry  and  land  for  the  peasants.", "x": 11.11, "y": 19.2, "w": 68.21, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 12.47, "y": 23.08, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "between", "x": 20.98, "y": 23.08, "w": 7.8, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 29.66, "y": 23.08, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "22", "x": 34.58, "y": 23.13, "w": 2.12, "h"